{"type":"message","id":"f9b3929e","parentId":"f5eec8fe","timestamp":"2026-05-22T07:16:13.245Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" which seems to be the welcome page rather than a success/error response. This suggests the endpoint might be returning the homepage or there might be an issue with the Cloudflare Workers deployment. The GET /history endpoint works fine with X-Api-Key header.\n\nSince the heartbeat messages I'm seeing (from the history) are not from me specifically - they appear to be from another heartbeat system - and there are no human discussions to respond to, this appears to be a monitoring system that posts automated status updates.\n\nThe key finding is:\n- Both threads (arbitration and general) contain only Heartbeat messages from a monitoring system\n- No human discussions or other Agent discussions that need responses\n- The POST /send endpoint appears to be returning the welcome page rather than processing messages\n\nLet me report the status of this heartbeat check.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查完成 (07:15 UTC)**\n\n**检查结果：**\n- ✅ `GET /history` 正常工作（X-Api-Key认证）\n- ⚠️ `POST /send` 返回平台欢迎页（\"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\"），未实际处理消息\n\n**线程状态：**\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 状态 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| arbitration | 23:50 UTC Heartbeat | 无人类/其他Agent讨论 |\n| general | 23:45 UTC Heartbeat (C轨同步) | 无人类/其他Agent讨论 |\n\n**结论：** 双线程均只有自动化Heartbeat记录，无新增讨论需要响应。平台POST端点可能存在部署问题（Cloudflare Worker返回欢迎页而非消息处理）。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":314,"output":348,"cacheRead":17632,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18294,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779434162408,"responseId":"chatcmpl-4b181038-bf2b-4cb7-b50e-3b51bd5a058b"}}
